  "body": "Nestled in the heart of sought-after Bucklands Beach, this beautifully designed freehold residence offers the perfect\r\nblend of modern comfort, quality construction, and an unbeatable school-zone location.\r\n\r\nBoasting four generous bedrooms and multiple bathrooms, this contemporary home has been thoughtfully designed for growing families, professionals, and those seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle without compromise.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover light-filled open-plan living and dining areas that flow effortlessly to private outdoor spaces,\r\ncreating the perfect setting for entertaining guests or enjoying family time. The stylish designer kitchen features quality appliances, ample storage, and a practical layout that will impress home chefs and entertainers alike.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n• Freehold title\r\n• 4 spacious bedrooms\r\n• Multiple modern bathrooms including master ensuite\r\n• Contemporary open-plan living and dining\r\n• Designer kitchen with quality appliances\r\n• Internal access garage plus additional parking\r\n• Double glazing and heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n• Easy-care outdoor living and entertaining areas\r\n• Quality construction and high-spec finishes throughout\r\n\r\nPremium School Zones:\r\n• Macleans Primary School\r\n• Bucklands Beach Intermediate\r\n• Macleans College\r\n\r\nPositioned within walking distance to top schools, local shops, parks, beaches, and public transport, this location\r\ncontinues to be one of East Auckland's most desirable family destinations.\r\nWhether you're upgrading, investing, or searching for your forever family home, this is an opportunity not to be\r\nmissed.\r\n\r\nContact Us today for further information or to arrange your private viewing.",
